Using parameters for start LND Bitcond on mainnet and testnet.

BITCOND: for start ONLY bitcoind service :
            - name: LND_BITCOIND
              value: "true" --- has to be set on TRUE
            - name: LND_NETWORK
              value: mainnet --- show on which network bitcoind will start
            - name: LND_PODNAME
               value: none --- will prevent start LND service on the same POD


 LND: for start ONLY bitcoind service :

              - name: LND_RPCHOST
                value: mbtc --- rpchost name to bitcoind service
              - name: LND_PODNAME
                value: slndID --- ldn host name
              - name: LND_BITCOIND
                value: "false" --- will prevent to start Bitcoind service on the same POD
              - name: LND_NETWORK
                value: mainnet --- show on which network LND will start

            - name: LND_EXTERNALIP
              value: 192.243.215.106
            - name: LND_PODNAME
              value: none
            - name: LND_BITCOIND
              value: "true"
            - name: LND_NETWORK
              value: mainnet
            - name: LND_ALIAS
              value: lqwd-lnd
            - name: LND_RPCUSER
              valueFrom:
                secretKeyRef:
                  name: secret
                  key: LND_RPCUSER
            - name: LND_RPCPASS
              valueFrom:
                secretKeyRef:
                  name: secret
                  key: LND_RPCPASS
            - name: LND_RPCHOST
              value: mbtc

            - name: WATCHTOWER -- watch tower parameter
              value: "true"




































